# Lint/type-check tooling for the CI "lint" job.
# Runtime deps (mcp, camt053) are included so mypy --strict can resolve the
# FastMCP types rather than treating them as untyped.
# ruff/black are pinned to the exact versions the CI lint job uses so the
# check stays deterministic across uv recompiles.
# GHSA-84m7-p3x7-pcfv: mcp >=1.8.0,<1.30.0 and >=2.0.0,<2.2.0 are affected.
